        "original_id": "baa24898-45a4-589c-94ed-1a9b5325e100",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jayaprakash Narayan\n- Organizations: People's Union for Civil Liberties\n- Awards: Bharat Ratna\n- Places: India\n\nFacts:\n- In 1976, Jayaprakash Narayan formed the People's Union for Civil Liberties and Democratic Rights in India.\n- The People's Union for Civil Liberties is a human rights body in India.\n- The People's Union for Civil Liberties was originally formed as the People's Union for Civil Liberties and Democratic Rights.\n- The Bharat Ratna is the highest civilian award of the Republic of India.\n- In 1999, Jayaprakash Narayan was posthumously awarded the Bharat Ratna in recognition of his social work.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
